  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A ball, moving horizontally, strikes a vertical wall. The ball rebounds horizontally.</p>\n<p>The mass of the ball is M and the change in magnitude of the momentum of the ball is Δp.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the impulse acting on the wall due to the ball? <br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">Mg + Δp</li><li data-label=\"B\">Mg − Δp</li><li data-label=\"C\">2Δp</li><li data-label=\"D\">Δp</li></ol>"
  },
